        "original_id": "7311ffc8-5e9a-5309-8587-a667b481183c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vienna\n- Organizations: Flex\n- People: High Contrast, Lincoln Barrett, Pendulum, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, Leopoi\n- Events: Waves Vienna\n- Topics: drum and bass, electronic music\n\nFacts:\n- Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\n- High Contrast is the stage name of Lincoln Barrett, who was born on 18 September 1979.\n- Lincoln Barrett is a Welsh electronic music producer, DJ, and record producer.\n- Flex has had hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs including Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, and Leopoi.\n- Waves Vienna takes place across music venues in Vienna including Fluc, Flex, and Odeon.",
